    "description": "Tupperware India South Asia Partners is actively seeking a talented and motivated Store Manager to join our dynamic team in Meerut. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Tupperware India South Asia Partners:\nTupperware India South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage store operations to ensure smooth daily functioning\n• Assist in recruiting, onboarding, and performance management of staff\n• Maintain high standards of store hygiene and cleanliness\n• Build relationships with regular customers to drive loyalty\n• Conduct regular stock audits and prevent pilferage\n• Monitor inventory levels and coordinate replenishment activities\n• Handle customer queries, complaints, and escalations effectively\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Retail Operations\n• Proficiency in Loss Prevention\n• Proficiency in Loyalty Programs\n• Proficiency in Visual Merchandising\n• Proficiency in E-commerce Integration\n• Proficiency in POS Systems\n• Proficiency in SAP Retail\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Meerut, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Tupperware India South Asia Partners!",
